    "formula": "integral_1^3 2x dif x=3^2-1^2=8",
    "text": "The other direction turns an integral into an endpoint subtraction. Since x squared differentiates to two x, subtract its value at one from its value at three. The change in accumulated area is nine minus one, or eight.",
